<title>USA: U.S. zinc stocks up in October - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. zinc stocks up in October - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. slab zinc stocks held by smelters rose to 6,174 short tons at the end of October from 5,584 short tons at the end of September, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Zinc production rose to 20,595 short tons in October from 19,548 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>Shipments from smelters' plants rose to 19,953 short tons in the month from 18,494 short tons in September.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
